<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <data noupdate="1">
        
        <!-- Indonesia Payroll Spreadsheet Template -->
        <record id="payrollstaging_indonesia" model="spreadsheet.spreadsheet">
            <field name="name">Indonesia Payroll Staging Data</field>
            <field name="data" type="base64" file="pb_hr_payroll_indonesia/data/indonesia_payroll_data.json"/>
        </record>
        
    </data>
</odoo>

<!-- 
RECOMMENDED SPREADSHEET HEADERS FOR INDONESIA PAYROLL:
Use these exact field names as column headers in Row 1 of your spreadsheet 
to ensure proper mapping to employee_staging_data table:

ESSENTIAL EMPLOYEE INFO:
- employee_id (Employee ID)
- first_name (First Name)  
- last_name (Last Name)
- email (Email)
- department (Department)
- designation (Job Title)

CORE SALARY COMPONENTS:
- base_salary (Basic Salary)
- gross_pay_idn (Gross Pay IDN)

KEY ALLOWANCES:
- fixed_allowance_1 (Fixed Allowance 1)
- fixed_allowance_2 (Fixed Allowance 2) 
- commission (Commission)
- tunjangan_sewa_rumah (Housing Allowance)
- gas_allowance (Transportation)
- meal_allowance (Meal Allowance)
- phone_allowance (Communication)

INDONESIA TAX & INSURANCE:
- pph21 (PPh 21 Income Tax)
- bpjs_kesehatan_employee (BPJS Health - Employee)
- bpjs_tk_jht_employee (BPJS Employment JHT - Employee)
- bpjs_tk_jp_employee (BPJS Pension - Employee)

KEY DEDUCTIONS:
- union_dues (Union Dues)
- loan_deductions (Loan/Coop Deductions)
- koperasi (Cooperative) 
- pinjaman (Personal Loans)
- lain_lain_deduction (Other Deductions)

ID NUMBERS:
- npwp_number (Tax ID/NPWP)
- bpjs_kesehatan_number (BPJS Health Number)
- bpjs_ketenagakerjaan_number (BPJS Employment Number)

SAMPLE HEADER ROW:
employee_id | first_name | last_name | department | base_salary | gross_pay_idn | pph21 | bpjs_kesehatan_employee | npwp_number

-->